silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_01_forge_engineer_entry_point_concrete_anchor_2#domesticcat_intermediate silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCat_intermediate is the typed intermediate stage DomesticCat: the cat after subspecies classification (Felis catus, TSN 183798); concrete instance: the rescued cat after the 2026-02-12 shelter classification step. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat_intermediate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
